<div class="img" style="background:url(https://www.minimetrospa.it/wp-content/themes/Divi-child/img/news-placeholder.png) center center no-repeat; background-size:cover;"><a href="https://www.minimetrospa.it/mini-letture-metropolitane/"><img decoding="async" src="https://www.minimetrospa.it/wp-content/themes/Divi-child/img/space-article.png" alt="Minimetro"></a></div>
